                "content": "```\nInput: num1 = 3, num2 = 5\nOutput: 3\nExplanation:\nThe binary representations of num1 and num2 are 0011 and 0101, respectively.\nThe integer 3 has the same number of set bits as num2, and the value 3 XOR 3 = 0 is minimal.\n```"
